        <!-- Kotak Detail Produk -->
        <article class="product-detail-card">
            <!-- Kolom Kiri: Gambar Produk Studio HD -->
            <div class="detail-image-column">
                <img id="detailMainImgSepatu" src="images/sepatu-urban-hd.jpg" alt="Foto Sepatu Urban hitam sporty" class="detail-product-image" width="640" height="480">
                <div class="detail-thumbnails-row" id="detailThumbnailsContainer">
                    <button type="button" class="detail-thumb-btn active" data-src="images/sepatu-urban-hd.jpg">
                        <img src="images/sepatu-urban-hd.jpg" alt="Angle Utama">
                        <span>Angle Utama</span>
                    </button>
                    <button type="button" class="detail-thumb-btn" data-src="images/sepatu-urban-side.jpg">
                        <img src="images/sepatu-urban-side.jpg" alt="Angle Samping">
                        <span>Tampak Samping</span>
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Kolom Kanan: Informasi & Pembelian Produk -->
            <div class="detail-info-column">
                <p class="detail-category" id="detailCategory">SEPATU KASUAL</p>
                <h1 class="detail-title" id="detailTitle">Sepatu Urban</h1>
                <p class="detail-price" id="detailPrice">Rp1.799.000</p>
                <p class="detail-description" id="detailDesc">
                    Sepatu kasual ringan yang dirancang khusus untuk kenyamanan aktivitas sehari-hari di perkotaan. Menggabungkan gaya minimalis kontemporer dengan durabilitas tinggi untuk menemani langkah aktif Anda dari pagi hingga malam.
                </p>

                <!-- Daftar Keunggulan Produk -->
                <div class="features-block">
                    <h2 class="features-heading">Keunggulan Produk:</h2>
                    <ul class="product-features" id="detailFeatures">
                        <li>Bahan kanvas ringan</li>
                        <li>Sol karet antiselip</li>
                        <li>Bantalan empuk</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <!-- Pilihan Ukuran / Varian (Flexbox) -->
                <div class="size-section">
                    <p class="size-title" id="detailOptionTitle">Pilih Ukuran:</p>
                    <div class="size-options" id="detailOptionsContainer">
                        <button type="button" class="size-btn active">39</button>
                        <button type="button" class="size-btn">40</button>
                        <button type="button" class="size-btn">41</button>
                        <button type="button" class="size-btn">42</button>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Tombol Aksi Utama -->
                <button type="button" class="buy-now-btn" id="btn-buy-sepatu">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="18" height="18" fill="currentColor">
